    "id": "thread-a-incident",
    "question": "IR-4 的事件处理能力应覆盖哪些阶段？",
    "events": [
      {
        "type": "intent",
        "intent": "knowledge"
      },
      {
        "type": "contexts",
        "contexts": [
          {
            "source": "NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL",
            "page": null,
            "domain": "隔离开发资料",
            "text": "Incident Handling\n[ir-4_smt.a] Implement an incident handling capability for incidents that is consistent with the incid",
            "locator": "ir-4",
            "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/usnistgov/oscal-content/f0de6d8d8c059d374f15e0ae07508d82e370fc1d/nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json"
          },
          {
            "source": "NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL",
            "page": null,
            "domain": "实验补充资料",
            "text": "Literacy Training and Awareness\n[at-2_smt.a] Provide security and privacy literacy training to system users (including m",
            "locator": "at-2",
            "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/usnistgov/oscal-content/f0de6d8d8c059d374f15e0ae07508d82e370fc1d/nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "token",
        "content": "**结论：** IR-4 要求建立与事件响应计划一致的事件处理能力，覆盖**准备、检测与分析、遏制、根除、恢复**五个阶段。\n\n**依据：** [ir-4_smt.a] 明确要求事件处理能力“consistent with the incident response plan and includes preparation, detection and analysis, containment, eradication, and recovery”。也就是说，这五个阶段是事件处理能力必须包含的内容；同时，该能力必须与事件响应计划保持一致。\n\n**补充要点（同一控制项的其他强制动作）：**\n- [ir-4_smt.b] 事件处理活动需与应急规划（contingency planning）活动协调。\n- [ir-4_smt.c] 需将事件处理过程中获得的经验教训纳入事件响应程序、培训和测试，并据此落实相应变更。\n- [ir-4_smt.d] 需确保事件处理活动的严谨性、强度、范围和结果在整个组织内具有可比性和可预测性。\n\n**易混淆点：** 这五个阶段是事件处理能力必须覆盖的内容，并非可选项；但资料未对每个阶段的具体操作步骤作进一步展开。\n\n【出处】[资料1]《NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL》定位【ir-4】"
      },
